# Azure Artifact Signing, formerly Trusted Signing.
#
# The single place these values are written down. Every other Locke Werks repo
# carries its own copy of metadata.json, which is how CertificateProfileName
# drifted into three different answers across four repositories:
#
#   MCPmcp, MTGSim     specterpoint
#   DeadLetter         lockewerks-public   (stale)
#   specterpoint       specterworks-public
#
# The certificate resolves to Specter Point Intelligence, LLC, the parent
# organisation, which is correct for a Locke Werks product.
#
# Consolidating on one profile is not only tidiness. Publisher reputation with
# SmartScreen accumulates across files signed by the same certificate, and EV
# certificates no longer bypass SmartScreen at all, so splitting releases across
# three profiles splits the reputation three ways for nothing.

LWI_SIGN_ENDPOINT=https://eus.codesigning.azure.net
LWI_SIGN_ACCOUNT=specterpoint
LWI_SIGN_PROFILE=specterpoint
